          "date": "2026-10-26 16:12:09.000000000",
          "tz": 60
        },
        "subject": "LU-21033 lfs: dk use TMPDIR as directory for temporary file",
        "message": "LU-21033 lfs: dk use TMPDIR as directory for temporary file\n\nThis patch allow user to specify the directory where to store the\ntemporary raw file used in lctl dk.\nlctl manpage has been updated accordingly to explain when temporary\nfile is needed.\n\nPrevious behaviour (TMPDIR is ignored):\n # TMPDIR=/dev/shm strace -e file -f -o /tmp/dk1 lctl dk /tmp/lctldk1\n Dumping temporary raw file to /tmp/lustre-log1793022271.124874\n Debug log: 1102 lines, 1102 kept, 0 dropped, 0 bad.\n # grep lustre-log /tmp/dk1\n 124874 stat(\"/tmp/lustre-log1793022271.124874\", 0x7ffd54c23c30) = -1 ENOENT\n 124874 openat(AT_FDCWD, \"/tmp/lustre-log1793022271.124874\", O_RDONLY) = 3\n 124874 unlink(\"/tmp/lustre-log1793022271.124874\") = 0\n\nWith this patch:\n # TMPDIR=/dev/shm strace -e file -f -o /tmp/dk1 lctl dk /tmp/lctldk1\n Dumping temporary raw file to /dev/shm/lustre-log1793022256.124869\n Debug log: 43896 lines, 43896 kept, 0 dropped, 0 bad.\n # grep lustre-log /tmp/dk1\n 124869 stat(\"/dev/shm/lustre-log1793022256.124869\", 0x7ffc550d7650) = -1 ENOENT\n 124869 openat(AT_FDCWD, \"/dev/shm/lustre-log1793022256.124869\", O_RDONLY) = 3\n 124869 unlink(\"/dev/shm/lustre-log1793022256.124869\") = 0\n\nChange-Id: I519d78f28194c3b7ac9d55e064eda025a3f5aa85\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly\nTest-Parameters: testlist=sanity,sanity-sec,sanity-scrub,sanity-krb5,\\\n                 sanity-lfsck,sanityn,sanity-selinux\nSigned-off-by: Aurélien Cedeyn <acedeyn@ddn.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
